      "prompt": "Glossy black (#0C0C10). Bright neon-tube lines like a sign: a hot-pink (#FF2BD6) neon tube running along the length on the middle row with sharp right-angle steps like a circuit trace, and two electric-cyan (#19E6FF) neon tubes running diagonally near the right end; each tube has a white-hot core and a coloured glow. The two thin strips at the far left are the joint collar: paint them plain flat silver (#B8BCC2).",
      "roll_deg": 45
    },
    "butt": {
      "refs": [
        "closeup",
        "full"
      ],
      "prompt": "Left thin strip (the ring): black with a thin hot-pink neon line and a thin cyan neon line. The wrap (from the ring to the next zone line): a black textured sport grip with a fine diamond crosshatch (#0C0C10 to #26262C), crossed by bold diagonal neon tubes, two hot-pink (#FF2BD6) and two electric-cyan (#19E6FF), evenly spaced, each glowing with a white-hot core. The butt sleeve (between the two zone lines on the right): glossy black with a cyan neon chevron pointing to the right on the middle row and a hot-pink neon ring at its right end. The very thin strip at the far right: plain black.",
      "roll_deg": 45
    }
